WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.010
In the face of The Holy Ground Treaty Organization's oppressive actions,

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:12.060
I call upon the entire population of Itogami Island to resist!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:17.120
The Japanese government has completely abandoned Itogami Island.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.550
Everyone may have doubts about our island's military power,

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.730
but please rest assured.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:27.720
This battle will be joined by the ambassador of the Warlord's Empire,

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:32.390
Lord Ardeal, His Highness Dimitrie Vatler.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:38.020
Also, we have enough power to oppose the Holy Ground Treaty forces.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.760
Please take a look.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.730
Glenda, go ahead.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:42.480
Da!

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:18.930
This is the bulwark of Itogami Island, known as Cain's Legacy.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.670
It's the same.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.970
The same scene I saw when I fell into Node.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:28.280
I see, Asagi.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.970
This is why you took Glenda away.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.860
Yep, all okay.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.640
That was perfect!

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:18.620
I'd never imagined that my stint as an idol would benefit me today.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:21.480
It's gone completely viral on the internet.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:26.190
Is this island chain the legacy that was protected by Glenda?

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:27.800
I think so.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:32.770
In the alternate dimension known as Node, it was a fortress used to protect humanity.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:37.500
In modern terminology, perhaps we can call it Cain's Ark?

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.680
Cain's Ark?

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:44.200
However, it doesn't contain pairs of animals.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.910
Instead, it has a pile of ancient weapons.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.890
You two, thank you for trusting me.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:55.530
Now Glenda-chan wont be targeted anymore.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.590
Glenda...

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.340
What do you mean she's the Guardian?

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:06.930
Only she knew the coordinates of Cain's Ark which was sealed within Node.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:10.370
And this is a part of the magic known as The Cleansing.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.050
The ability to change the world by transporting the entirety of Cain's Legacy here.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:19.430
She is literally the Guardian of the Treasury.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.480
Anyway, Glenda-chan's role is over.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.360
Take her away if you want.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:31.440
Though it may be a bit difficult to leave the island now.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.970
Asagi-chan, do you truely wish to protect Itogami Island?

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:39.290
Well, I can't really help it.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:43.440
If the government is unwilling to protect us, then we have no choice but to defend ourselves.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.100
Why do you not hesitate at all?

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.590
Because I was born and raised in the demon district.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:57.420
Mistress, the enemy fleet has started to move.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.660
Two destroyers have separated from the rest of the fleet.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:02.860
They're probably on a reconnaissance mission.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:04.830
Tank Rider!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.050
Roger that!

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:12.050
We will make them regret attacking our island.

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:14.080
Time to fight!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.910
It's worthy of being called Cain's Legacy.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.680
It's spectacular!

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.730
Isn't it too huge?

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:26.150
Did they transport this enormous thing out of Node?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:29.390
Natsuki-chan!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.620
Why did she suddenly...?

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.360
Minamiya-sensei!

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:36.330
She's dead?

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:40.810
Don't just kill me off like that.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:41.560
Eh?

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.530
There's... two Minamiya-senseis?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.530
It's a side effect of Aiba invoking The Cleansing.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.670
My seal was destroyed.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.780
Now the Prison Barrier has appeared in reality.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:55.240
I was forced to wake up from my dream.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:56.810
So that means...

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:59.120
you are the raw Natsuki-chan?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.280
Don't speak of someone like they are fresh food!

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:06.260
Please wait a moment. Appeared in reality...

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:12.090
Will the magic criminals imprisoned inside use this chance to escape?

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:15.010
No way! Will it be the Halloween Fiesta again?

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.110
That wont happen.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:19.980
But there is a bigger problem.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:25.760
Akatsuki Nagisa's time stopped because she was in my dream.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.890
But I woke up.

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:34.510
Take us to where Nagisa is... right now!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.840
That's really amazing.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:42.940
To attack defenseless civilians was an unenviable task.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.700
But this lets us relax a little.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:48.030
Enemy combat potential is unknown.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:51.390
At this stage we don't really know if we can relax.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.830
That's right.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.590
Cain's Legacy, eh?

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.250
What in the world will appear next?

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.650
Ca... Captain! Look at that!

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:04.590
That's...

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:06.930
Nalakuvera!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.090
Kanase!

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:16.320
Kanon-chan!

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:19.180
Your injuries have healed, Onii-san?

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.430
Thank goodness.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:22.120
I'm fine.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.430
More importantly, Kanase, are you alright?

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:26.550
You used so much of your power to help Nagisa.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.160
Kanon-chan, you should get some rest.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.610
I'll take over.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:32.680
Don't worry about me.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:35.810
There's nothing else I can do.

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:40.690
Take a break, Priestess of Valkyria.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.890
Thou have done thy duty.

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:50.130
You're Hektos.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.290
Why are you here?

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:53.200
A pointless question.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.770
Aren't thou trying to save this person?

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.600
Then let's get started.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.550
It's time for the final Banquet.

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:07.800
Wow! Nalakuvera?

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:10.440
As expected of the Snake Charmer of the Warlord's Empire.

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:13.540
He brought out some dangerous stuff.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.940
Destroyers Bursa and Crossley,

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.010
both ships are unable to continue sailing.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.330
Roger.

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:24.750
Then our job is to find the person who controls the Nalakuvera.

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:26.520
It's coming.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.680
Spread out!

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:37.730
Well coordinated movements...

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:41.400
That equipment is from the North Sea Empire's SAS?

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:43.930
A worthy opponent!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.410
A beautiful night.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:56.280
Can we really can hold a Banquet here?

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.010
Yes.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:02.280
The place where thou and I are, that's the stage for the Banquet.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.110
Eh? Hektos?

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.120
Y... You...

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:14.190
Did you wear that yukata without any underwear?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.870
Senpai, that's not what you should be paying attention to.

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:41.770
Senpai!

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.750
I know, take care of Nagisa.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.470
Hektos, where are you?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.210
Senpai, are you alright?

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.300
Himeragi!

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:06.130
Hektos, what were you thinking?

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:08.020
Don't be angry, Kojou.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.550
Thou art the King.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:15.520
Everything in the world is your blood, your family.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.230
Remove those boring clothes.

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:19.280
Hektos?

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.720
Alrescha Glacies.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.610
The Twelfth Familiar is in that human body.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:27.750
Thou has always known.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:28.810
Ah...

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:33.070
To save Akatsuki Nagisa's life is very simple.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:36.990
Thou need only to extract the Twelfth Familiar from her.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.440
I see!

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:43.420
I just need to take the Familiar from Nagisa's body, right?

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:46.140
No, Kojou-kun...

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:50.500
If you do that, Avrora-san will disappear.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.070
This time... she really will.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.840
Nagisa, you...

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:59.770
If Akatsuki Nagisa dies, Dodekatos will also disappear.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.610
I have to kill her again?

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.120
Avrora.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:09.420
No, we will not allow Dodekatos to be destroyed.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.730
Because she is our hope.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:13.530
Hope?

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:17.690
Yes, for this reason it is I who shall disappear.

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:21.440
Sword Priestess,

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:27.270
the first blood servant of the Fourth Progenitor at the end of eternity,

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.270
I entrust my Familiar to thee.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.410
Hektos!

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:36.520
What are you doing to Himeragi?

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:37.680
Don't worry.

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:42.480
From now on, all of my blood and soul will return to thee.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:53.800
Huh?

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:56.100
Hektos! Go away.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.910
Himeragi is watching.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:11:59.990
That's fine.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.630
Let her experience our foolishness

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:05.880
and let thy sister see clearly.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.750
Wake up, Dodekatos.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.750
No, the Twelfth Avrora!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.060
Otherwise, this man will belong to me.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:29.060
That's right, Dudekatos.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.990
Hektos!

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:32.380
You, no way...

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:38.110
Ever since the Scorched Banquet, we have spent an eternity alongside the Familiars.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:44.090
The twelve of us have long desired for our own destruction,

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.010
except for one.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.750
Dodekatos still wishes to live.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:53.220
She wishes to live alongside thee in this world.

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:58.810
Dudekatos, she is our beloved youngest sister.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:05.410
Our last remaining body we bequeath to thee.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.380
Take it.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:13.200
As a blood servant of Akatsuki Kojou, successor to the blood of Kaleid Blood,

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.700
I, Sword Shaman of the High God, beseech thee...

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:16.760
Himeragi?

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:21.570
Come, Sixth Familiar, Minelauva Iris!

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:49.120
Kojou-kun?

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.630
How is Avrora-san?

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:53.930
Don't worry, she's right here.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.640
I see.

00:13:57.840 --> 00:13:59.340
Sorry...

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:03.580
It's all my fault, Kojou-kun.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:04.930
Nagisa? Hey!

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:07.470
It's alright, she just fell asleep.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.640
Himeragi... are you alright?

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:13.930
Yes, Hektos-san lent me her power.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.760
Besides, I'm Senpai's blood servant.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.210
Am I all right... this is what you meant?

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:25.760
Wait, I'm purely concerned about your well-being.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:31.600
Forget it, I already knew that's how you are, Senpai.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.480
Himeragi?

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:40.590
I know it, Senpai, you are cold yourself, right?

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.650
This way we can warm each other up.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.710
It's killing two birds with one stone.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:49.650
And it saves me from your indecent staring.

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:51.090
You...

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.290
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.030
What are you doing to Yukina, you Perverted Progenitor?

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.780
Looks like everyone had a good time last night.

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:01.830
Sayaka-san.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:02.790
La Folia.

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:04.110
Why are you here?

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.860
I've been looking for you, Kojou.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:10.240
But before that, we'll let the girls rest.

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.130
So, why were you looking for me?

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:22.380
Do you understand the situation on this island?

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.030
The gist of it.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.980
Asagi is planning to fight against the Holy Ground Treaty forces.

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:34.150
The appearance of Cain's Legacy prevented the unilateral destruction of Itogami Island.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:38.050
But that's not the core of the problem.

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:39.540
What do you mean?

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:40.940
For better or worse,

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.680
The Holy Ground Treaty

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:47.260
is a system based on the power of the three Progenitors.

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:50.430
But on Itogami Island right now,

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.300
there is someone who possesses the memory of The Cleansing

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.820
who has gained enough power to rival those of the Progenitors.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:57.090
Vatler.

00:15:57.710 --> 00:16:02.020
He has also entered into alliances with countries who are not allied

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.910
with the Holy Ground Treaty and obtained their support.

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:08.470
As a result, the world has split into opposing sides

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:11.130
with the spotlight on Itogami Island.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:15.120
You mean that Itogami Island will become the fuse for war?

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.920
And it will be a world war on the largest scale.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:21.260
In order to prevent that scenario from occuring,

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.310
the Holy Ground Treaty Organization has to utilize its greatest power.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.170
In other words, the three Progenitors.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.300
Vatler.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.850
Does he intend to fight against the Progenitors?

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:34.620
That's right.

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:38.510
This will be a world war involving all of the Progenitors.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:40.720
The War Of Original Vampires.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:43.280
The War Of Original Vampires?

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:45.050
How do we stop it?

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:49.760
That depends on your decision, Kojou. Let's go.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.120
Go... where?

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.930
The Garden of Whispers.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:58.900
The Supreme Council of the Holy Ground Treaty Organization.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.130
This is it?

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:03.830
Yes.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.300
It is a magic tool given by our Progenitor.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.810
It's the gate to The Garden of Whispers.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:13.760
The Supreme Council consists of three permanent members

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:17.490
and the representatives of nine non-permanent members: a total of twelve members.

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:22.170
As long as you can convince more than half of the delegates, it will be possible to end this war.

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:26.360
Which means I have to convince at least seven people?

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:30.850
But, the invasion of Itogami Island has already been decided.

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:33.270
It won't be easily overturned.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:38.430
Oh my, isn't there another way to overturn the council's decision?

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:41.790
Veto rights.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:42.800
Veto rights?

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.610
The permanent members of the Supreme Council,

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:49.350
the three Vampire Progenitors from the Empires of the Night,

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:52.960
are given veto powers in the Supreme Council.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:56.720
In other words, if one of the Progenitors opposes it,

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.970
then the decision of the Supreme Council can be overturned!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.830
Don't expect things to go that smoothly.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:07.420
The Vampire Progenitors are a group who tire of boredom even more so than Vatler.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.190
It's a rare opportunity to wage war.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.220
I don't think they will let this chance slip by.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.250
That's all I can do for you, Kojou.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.060
Please bear one thing in mind.

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:26.400
What is your identity now?

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.460
This is... The Garden of Whispers?

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:39.480
Welcome, Fourth Progenitor.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:44.430
How long has it been since an uninvited guest set foot into this garden?

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.650
We cannot offer you any hospitality, but we can listen to what you have to say.

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.840
For what purpose have you come here?

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.540
I have only one request:

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.650
Leave Itogami Island alone,

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:58.510
revoke its designation as a magical weapon of mass destruction,

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:01.110
and withdraw the multi-national fleet immediately.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.910
The request is denied.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:07.320
But if it continues like this, it might really become a world war!

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:10.570
When Itogami Island is wiped out,

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:13.180
the threat of The Cleansing will disappear.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:16.480
There will be no reason for the countries not allied with The Holy Ground Treaty to oppose us.

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:21.470
Destroying Itogami Island is the foolproof way of obtaining world peace.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.740
Don't mess with me!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.400
Exploiting The Cleansing,

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.630
and involving countries not allied with The Holy Ground Treaty,

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:27.490
it was all Vatler's doing.

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:30.480
Isn't this exactly what that bastard wants?

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:32.740
If you all insist on attacking,

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:35.370
then I will be your enemy.

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:38.220
You are free to do that, Fourth Progenitor.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:40.620
We will not succumb to threats.

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.880
Is that all you have to say?

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:46.970
<i>Please bear one thing in mind, Kojou.</i>

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:54.690
I see.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:57.140
La Folia, that's what you meant.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:20:00.270
It wasn't necessary to negotiate with them to begin with.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:04.210
In this Garden of Whispers conference,

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:08.680
The Vampire Progenitors have veto rights, correct?

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.310
That's right.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.200
Then it's simple.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:16.850
I veto the attack on Itogami Island

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:18.660
as the Fourth Progenitor!

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:19.560
What?

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:24.090
I see, so you're using this trick?

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.690
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.980
Certainly, the Holy Ground Treaty

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:33.820
gives veto rights only to Vampire Progenitors.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:38.630
It doesn't specify that there can only be three Progenitors

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:40.910
because in the past it was a self-evident fact.

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:41.890
In that case!

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:46.180
But we still can't accept it, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:50.770
To proclaim yourself as the Fourth Progenitor, you still lack something.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.000
I still... lack something?

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:57.240
One who calls him Progenitor must be the sovereign of an Empire of the Night,

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:01.120
but you don't have any territory.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.210
I have a territory.

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:04.300
Which place is it?

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:07.000
Itogami Island.

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:12.500
The Japanese government has abandoned the territorial rights to Itogami Island.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.650
In that case, no one can complain if it's occupied by me.

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:21.940
Oh? Indeed, as you said, there would be no issue with recognizing you as a Progenitor.

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:27.300
But, the key is that you don't seem to have control over the island.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:31.550
In other words, if I can yeet Vatler off of Itogami Island,

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:33.930
you will accept me as a Progenitor?

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.980
We consider Itogami Island as a threat

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.570
because it is the Altar for The Cleansing.

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:45.520
If the threat of The Cleansing can be eliminated without expending any effort,

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.320
that's a good outcome for us.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:54.190
I believe there's merit in considering the request of the Fourth Progenitor. What do you all think?

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:57.230
We agree with the conditions.

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:59.130
But there's not much time left.

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.370
Indeed.

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:03.290
Then, we will give you 24 hours.

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:07.910
If you can gain complete control of Itogami Island within this time,

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:10.430
we will recognize the veto power of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:12.630
Suits me.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:49.390
Itogami Island and man-made islands in the surrounding area

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:53.690
is the territory of the Fourth Progenitor as recognized by the Holy Ground Treaty Organization.

00:23:53.690 --> 00:24:00.950
Therefore, those who illegally occupy the territory should disarm and surrender all rights to the area.

00:24:01.450 --> 00:24:02.370
What!?

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:06.310
If you don't accept these requirements, we will remove you by force.

00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:09.380
The Fourth Progenitor, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:24:10.280 --> 00:24:12.680
What is going on in that idiot's head?

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:16.230
Who does he think we're doing all this for?

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:19.790
Even though the order is different from the initial plan.

00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:22.810
This actually makes things easier, so I welcome it.

00:24:23.370 --> 00:24:28.720
I originally assumed it would be much harder to motivate Kojou to fight.

00:24:29.120 --> 00:24:32.790
I won't help you if you're going to fight Kojou.

00:24:32.790 --> 00:24:35.640
Of course, it doesn't matter.

00:24:35.640 --> 00:24:37.460
We finally get the chance to kill each other.

00:24:37.460 --> 00:24:40.950
To use something as unromantic as The Cleansing would be far too disappointing.

00:24:40.950 --> 00:24:42.360
I'll go talk to him.

00:24:42.360 --> 00:24:45.020
I'll persuade Kojou to join us.

00:24:45.020 --> 00:24:45.900
Got a problem with that?

00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:47.560
Do whatever you want.

00:24:47.560 --> 00:24:52.560
Kojou and I standing shoulder to shoulder against the three Progenitors,

00:24:52.720 --> 00:24:54.890
that's also a very attractive idea.

00:24:57.260 --> 00:25:00.350
We have discovered the location of the Oceanus Grave II.

00:25:00.490 --> 00:25:02.470
It's time to begin the attack.

00:25:02.840 --> 00:25:03.480
Yeah.

00:25:03.480 --> 00:25:05.950
Justina, contact the Bifrost.

00:25:06.120 --> 00:25:08.250
From now on, the Order of the Sacred Ring

00:25:08.250 --> 00:25:11.560
will assist our ally sovereign, Akatsuki Kojou,

00:25:11.560 --> 00:25:14.330
in attacking the Oceanus Grave II.

00:25:14.330 --> 00:25:15.000
Roger!

00:25:15.130 --> 00:25:19.440
In order to assist you, we have prepared the Airship "Night Owl".

00:25:19.560 --> 00:25:20.600
I got it.

00:25:20.780 --> 00:25:24.600
But I was surprised that you were willing to help us.

00:25:24.650 --> 00:25:29.140
Vatler's actions were acts of rebellion against the Warlord's Empire.

00:25:29.260 --> 00:25:33.390
Participating in his punishment is the obligation of every subject of the Empire.

00:25:34.140 --> 00:25:36.100
Whatever the reason, thank you for your help.

00:25:36.100 --> 00:25:37.310
Senpai...

00:25:38.380 --> 00:25:39.570
Let's get started.

00:25:40.970 --> 00:25:43.190
Wait for me, Asagi.

00:25:43.190 --> 00:25:44.220
Vatler!
